ted skills, MCP tools, and apps exposed elsewhere in this turn.\n- Missing/blocked: If the user requests a plugin that does not have relevant callable capabilities for the task, say so briefly and continue with the best fallback.\n","provenance":{"type":"model","model":"gpt-6-astra"}},"history_mode":"paginated","context_window":{"window_id":"01a154ea-88e2-7801-b14f-343dc46205a7"},"git":{"commit_hash":"8cd582bc76a5b8756ee7f783dfbe17761c0b4d49","branch":"main","repository_url":"git@github.com:Printeger/instinctRL.git"}}}
